#: nectar/customizer/panels/general-settings.php:357
msgid ""
"If you're trying to get third party forms to display without any styling "
"from NectarBlocks, simply select the"
msgstr ""
"Pokud se snažíte zobrazit formuláře třetích stran bez jakéhokoli stylování "
"od NectarBlocks, jednoduše vyberte"

